    <guid isPermaLink="false">6728cfe533c798676f65f167</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 14:30:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>J人说月更一定会更……</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是迟到一年的港剧《新闻女王》推荐，如果你还没有看的话请入坑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 今日主题：跟我一起复习《新闻女王》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 角色点评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 最近面试经历感悟插曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 许诗晴的情色资本换不来自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 晓薇带着原生家庭的影响负重前行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 新闻改革怎么改？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 人设BUG小小的疑惑一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 原来香港和我们的新闻大不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> 纸媒还有明天吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> </span><strong><span>我最喜欢的嗑CP环节！大写！加粗！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 其他琐碎的小吐槽（我看剧的时候真的想好多哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:炎明熹《Crystal Clear》</span></p>]]></description>
